# Quick settings panel: wifi, bluetooth, audio and battery, ported by hand from
# caelestia-shell's bar popouts (modules/bar/popouts). Reached as
# `import quicksettings`, which needs QML2_IMPORT_PATH=~/.config/quickshell —
# set in niri's modules/environment.kdl.
#
# Shared widgets and the palette live in ../common; only what is specific to
# these four panels is here.
#
# The panels carry a `Panel` suffix so they cannot shadow the singletons they
# use: an unsuffixed Bluetooth.qml would hide Quickshell.Bluetooth's own
# Bluetooth singleton, and likewise Audio.qml would hide the service below.
module quicksettings

singleton Audio 1.0 Audio.qml
singleton Icons 1.0 Icons.qml
singleton Nmcli 1.0 Nmcli.qml

AudioPanel 1.0 AudioPanel.qml
BatteryPanel 1.0 BatteryPanel.qml
BluetoothPanel 1.0 BluetoothPanel.qml
NetworkPanel 1.0 NetworkPanel.qml
PopoutState 1.0 PopoutState.qml
WirelessPassword 1.0 WirelessPassword.qml
